{"path":"Quantum.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<meta name="description" content="Quantum — a self-contained interactive tour of the eight experiments that built quantum mechanics, from Planck's blackbody to Aspect's entangled photons."/>
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light"/>
<title>Quantum — The Experiments That Built It</title>
<style>
/* ============================ THEME TOKENS ============================ */
:root{
  --bg:#05070d;
  --bg-2:#0a0f1c;
  --surface:rgba(13,20,36,.62);
  --surface-2:#0d1424;
  --text:#e8eefb;
  --muted:#93a4c3;
  --faint:#5b6b8c;
  --accent:#5eead4;
  --accent-2:#8b9dff;
  --accent-3:#f0abfc;
  --line:rgba(148,163,199,.15);
  --line-strong:rgba(148,163,199,.34);
  --glow:rgba(94,234,212,.16);
  --glow-1:rgba(94,234,212,.09);
  --glow-2:rgba(139,157,255,.08);
  --sim-bg:#04070e;
  --soft:rgba(148,163,184,.09);
  --shadow:0 22px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
  --danger:#fb7185;
  --warn:#fbbf24;
  --good:#34d399;
  --btn-ink:#04121a;
  --header-bg:rgba(5,7,13,.72);
  --serif:"Iowan Old Style","Palatino Linotype",Palatino,Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  --sans:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
  --mono:ui-monospace,"SF Mono","Cascadia Code",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
}
[data-theme="light"]{
  --bg:#f3f6fc;
  --bg-2:#e9eef8;
  --surface:rgba(255,255,255,.82);
  --surface-2:#ffffff;
  --text:#0e1626;
  --muted:#44536f;
  --faint:#7b89a6;
  --accent:#0d9488;
  --accent-2:#5b5bd6;
  --accent-3:#c026d3;
  --line:rgba(20,35,70,.13);
  --line-strong:rgba(20,35,70,.3);
  --glow:rgba(13,148,136,.12);
  --glow-1:rgba(13,148,136,.10);
  --glow-2:rgba(91,91,214,.09);
  --sim-bg:#ffffff;
  --soft:rgba(15,30,60,.06);
  --shadow:0 20px 48px rgba(30,50,90,.14);
  --danger:#e11d48;
  --warn:#d97706;
  --good:#059669;
  --btn-ink:#ffffff;
  --header-bg:rgba(243,246,252,.78);
}

/* ============================ BASE ============================ */
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
  font-family:var(--sans);line-height:1.6;font-size:15.5px;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;
  transition:background .35s,color .35s;
}
::selection{background:var(--accent);color:var(--btn-ink)}
a{color:inherit}
.bg{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-2;pointer-events:none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 88% -12%, var(--glow-1), transparent 62%),
    radial-gradient(950px 720px at -8% 34%, var(--glow-2), transparent 58%),
    radial-gradient(760px 560px at 55% 118%, var(--glow-1), transparent 60%),
    var(--bg);
}
#progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:2px;width:0;z-index:120;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
section{scroll-margin-top:72px}

/* ============================ HEADER ============================ */
header{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
  background:var(--header-bg);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.nav-inner{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:0 18px;height:58px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;text-decoration:none;flex:0 0 auto}
.brand-mark{
  font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);
  width:34px;height:34px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:10px;
  border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:var(--surface);align-self:center;
  box-shadow:0 0 18px var(--glow);
}
.brand-name{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.01em}
.brand-sub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint)}
nav.nav{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-left:auto;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;padding:4px 2px}
nav.nav::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
nav.nav a{
  font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;
  white-space:nowrap;transition:color .2s,background .2s;font-weight:500;
}
nav.nav a:hover{color:var(--text);background:var(--soft)}
nav.nav a.active{color:var(--accent);background:var(--soft)}
.theme-btn{
  flex:0 0 auto;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;
  border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);
  font-size:16px;line-height:1;display:grid;place-items:center;transition:.2s;
}
.theme-btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 16px var(--glow)}

/* ============================ HERO ============================ */
.hero{min-height:calc(100vh - 58px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
#heroCanvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
.hero-veil{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;
  background:radial-gradient(60% 60% at 50% 42%, transparent 0%, var(--bg) 100%);}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;text-align:center;padding:56px 22px 40px;max-width:860px}
.kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:20px}
h1{
  font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em;line-height:.95;
  font-size:clamp(64px,12vw,132px);
  background:linear-gradient(118deg,var(--text) 28%,var(--accent) 72%,var(--accent-2) 96%);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
}
.sub{margin:24px auto 30px;max-width:660px;color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(15px,1.9vw,18px)}
.hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.formulae{margin-top:38px;display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.formulae code{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--faint);
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;background:var(--surface);
}
.scroll-hint{
  position:absolute;bottom:22px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;z-index:2;
}
.scroll-hint span{width:1px;height:34px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),transparent);animation:drip 1.8s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes drip{0%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:top}55%{transform:scaleY(1);transform-origin:top}56%{transform-origin:bottom}100%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:bottom}}

/* ============================ BUTTONS / CHIPS ============================ */
.btn{
  display:inline-block;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;
  text-decoration:none;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;font-family:var(--sans);
}
.btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:var(--btn-ink);box-shadow:0 8px 28px var(--glow)}
.btn.primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 34px var(--glow)}
.btn.ghost{border-color:var(--line-strong);color:var(--text);background:var(--surface)}
.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.chipbtn{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;padding:8px 13px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;
  border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--text);
}
.chipbtn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--glow)}
.chip{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;
  border:1px solid var(--line-strong);color:var(--muted);background:var(--surface);white-space:nowrap;
}
.chip.year{color:var(--accent);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 40%,transparent)}

/* ============================ TIMELINE ============================ */
.timeline-section{padding:74px 0 66px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.sec-kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:12px}
h3.sec-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,38px);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px}
.sec-lede{color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;margin-bottom:30px}
.timeline{display:flex;gap:14px;overflow-x:auto;padding:8px 2px 16px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:thin}
.tl-card{
  min-width:206px;max-width:230px;scroll-snap-align:start;
  background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 16px 14px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);transition:transform .25s,border-color .25s;
}
.tl-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--line-strong)}
.tl-year{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
.tl-name{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:6px 0 5px}
.tl-card p{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}

/* ============================ EXPERIMENTS ============================ */
.exp{padding:86px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.exp-head{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:34px}
.exp-index{
  font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(52px,8vw,88px);line-height:.9;font-weight:700;
  color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.4px var(--line-strong);flex:0 0 auto;
}
.exp-meta{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}
.exp h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(27px,4vw,42px);font-weight:600;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.lede{color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(14.5px,1.6vw,16.5px);max-width:760px;margin-top:12px}
.exp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.18fr;gap:26px;align-items:start}
.exp.flip .prose{order:2}
.prose{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.prose-block{
  background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
}
.prose-block h4{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:7px;font-weight:600;
}
.prose-block p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.prose-block p b{color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
.eq{
  margin-top:2px;border:1px dashed var(--line-strong);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.eq-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint)}
.eq code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:15px;color:var(--accent)}

/* ============================ SIM CARD ============================ */
.simcard{
  background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:16px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
}
.simcard-head{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;
  letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);margin-bottom:12px;
}
.simcard-head .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--good);box-shadow:0 0 9px var(--good);animation:pulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.35}}
.sim-hint{margin-left:auto;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:none}
canvas.sim{
  width:100%;height:clamp(300px,44vw,420px);display:block;border-radius:12px;
  background:var(--sim-bg);border:1px solid var(--line);
}
canvas.sim.tall{height:clamp(330px,47vw,470px)}
.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:16px 18px;margin-top:16px}
.ctl{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.ctl-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.ctl-label output{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:500}
.sw-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
.range-wrap{position:relative;padding-top:2px}
.tick{
  position:absolute;top:50%;width:3px;height:16px;background:var(--danger);
  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:2px;pointer-events:none;box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--danger);
}
input[type="range"]{
  -webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:4px;border-radius:4px;
  background:var(--line-strong);outline:none;cursor:pointer;
}
input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb{
  -webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));
  border:2px solid var(--bg);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--glow),0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.4);cursor:pointer;
}
input[type="range"]::-moz-range-thumb{
  width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));
  border:2px solid var(--bg);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--glow);cursor:pointer;
}
select{
  background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius:9px;padding:9px 10px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;width:100%;
}
.switch{position:relative;width:42px;height:22px;display:inline-block;flex:0 0 auto}
.switch input{opacity:0;width:0;height:0;position:absolute}
.switch span{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--line-strong);border-radius:999px;transition:.25s;cursor:pointer}
.switch span::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;
  background:#fff;transition:.25s;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
}
.switch input:checked + span{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2))}
.switch input:checked + span::after{transform:translateX(20px)}
.stats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}
.stat{
  background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;
  padding:8px 12px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.3;min-width:96px;
}
.stat b{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;color:var(--text);font-weight:600;margin-top:1px}
.meter-wrap{margin-top:14px}
.meter-wrap label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.meter{height:8px;background:var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:7px}
.meter i{display:block;height:100%;width:0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));transition:width .35s}
.btnrow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}

/* ============================ OUTRO / FOOTER ============================ */
.outro{padding:96px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:center}
.outro .quote{
  font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(24px,3.6vw,38px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.35;
  max-width:760px;margin:18px auto 14px;
  background:linear-gradient(110deg,var(--text),var(--accent));
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
}
.outro p.body{color:var(--muted);max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 40px}
.pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:16px;max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;text-align:left}
.pillar{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px}
.pillar .num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.18em}
.pillar h5{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:8px 0 6px}
.pillar p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
footer{
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 22px 44px;text-align:center;
  color:var(--faint);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.9;
}
footer .fbrand{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
footer code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}

/* ============================ REVEAL / RESPONSIVE ============================ */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (max-width:960px){
  .exp-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .exp.flip .prose{order:0}
  .exp{padding:64px 0}
  .exp-head{gap:14px}
  .brand-sub{display:none}
}
@media (max-width:560px){
  nav.nav a{font-size:11.5px;padding:5px 8px}
  .stats .stat{min-width:calc(50% - 12px)}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg"></div>
<div id="progress"></div>

<!-- ============================ HEADER ============================ -->
<header>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="#hero">
      <span class="brand-mark">Q</span>
      <span class="brand-name">Quantum</span>
      <span class="brand-sub">experiments</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav" id="nav" aria-label="Experiments">
      <a href="#blackbody">Blackbody</a>
      <a href="#photoelectric">Photoelectric</a>
      <a href="#compton">Compton</a>
      <a href="#stern">Stern–Gerlach</a>
      <a href="#davisson">Diffraction</a>
      <a href="#slits">Double Slit</a>
      <a href="#hydrogen">Hydrogen</a>
      <a href="#bell">Bell</a>
    </nav>
    <button id="themeBtn" class="theme-btn" aria-label="Switch to light theme" title="Switch theme">☀</button>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============================ HERO ============================ -->
<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <canvas id="heroCanvas"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-veil"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="kicker">1900 — 1982 · An interactive reconstruction</p>
    <h1>Quantum</h1>
    <p class="sub">Eight experiments, one revolution. Operate each apparatus yourself — from Planck's
    glowing cavity to Aspect's entangled photons — and watch the classical world fail, one result at a time.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#blackbody" class="btn primary">Begin the tour</a>
      <a href="#timeline" class="btn ghost">The timeline</a>
    </div>
    <div class="formulae">
      <code>E = hν</code><code>K<sub>max</sub> = hν − φ</code><code>Δλ = (h/mc)(1−cosθ)</code>
      <code>S<sub>z</sub> = ± ħ/2</code><code>nλ = 2d sinθ</code><code>E<sub>n</sub> = −13.6 eV / n²</code><code>|S| ≤ 2 ?</code>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint"><span></span>scroll</div>
</section>

<!-- ============================ TIMELINE ============================ -->
<section class="timeline-section" id="timeline">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="sec-kicker">The road to quantum</p>
      <h3 class="sec-title">A century of stubborn experiments</h3>
      <p class="sec-lede">No one planned to invent quantum mechanics. It was extracted, year by year, from
      measurements that refused to make classical sense. Drag the timeline, then dive into the apparatuses below.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline reveal">
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1885</div><div class="tl-name">Balmer</div><p>An empirical formula for hydrogen's visible lines — no theory, just a pattern.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1900</div><div class="tl-name">Planck</div><p>Energy comes in packets. The quantum is born in a patent office.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1905</div><div class="tl-name">Einstein</div><p>Light itself is quantized: the photon explains the photoelectric effect.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1913</div><div class="tl-name">Bohr</div><p>Quantized orbits explain the atomic line spectra.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1922</div><div class="tl-name">Stern &amp; Gerlach</div><p>A beam of atoms splits into two — spin is discovered.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1923</div><div class="tl-name">Compton</div><p>X-rays scatter like particles: photons carry momentum.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1925–26</div><div class="tl-name">Heisenberg &amp; Schrödinger</div><p>Matrix mechanics and wave mechanics: the theory arrives.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1927</div><div class="tl-name">Davisson &amp; Germer</div><p>Electrons diffract off nickel. Matter waves are real.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1935</div><div class="tl-name">Einstein, Podolsky &amp; Rosen</div><p>"Spooky action at a distance" — the completeness challenge.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1964</div><div class="tl-name">Bell</div><p>An inequality no local hidden-variable theory can beat.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-year">1982</div><div class="tl-name">Aspect</div><p>Entangled photons violate the bound. Local realism is overruled.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

